  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "決策與賽局:溝通創造雙贏",
    "sub_ename": "DECISION MAKING AND GAME THEORY: COMMUNICATION CREATES A WIN-WIN SITUATION",
    "describe_ch": "正確的決策是藝術也是能力。本課程理論結合實務，透過課堂實作及工具設計，由淺入深，引導學生達成「理性人」的「理性選擇」。本課程以賽局理論作為基礎，透過善用「溝通工具」、讓學生系統化、有效率且精準的進行「正確決策」，達成雙贏，另一方面也協助學生形成可複製的「路徑依賴」。讓學生能在職場上，能快速在專業領域上，一展長材。",
    "describe_eh": "Make the right decision is both an art and ability.\nCombining the theory with practice, through classroom practice and tool design, this course guides students to achieve the rational choice of rational people. This course is based on the Game Theory, via the good use of communication tools, students can make correct decisions in a systematically, efficiently, and accurately make correct decisions to achieve a win-win situation. Besides, this course will help students form a replicable path dependence. It enables students to quickly develop their talents in the professional field in the workplace.\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
